                " href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10639-024-12602-5#ref-CR96" id="ref-link-section-d81076584e563">b</a>). It also decreases the teaching load for educators. VR and AR apps act as a guide through the learning process (Bacca et al., <a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference 2015" title="Bacca, J., Baldiris, S., Fabregat, R., &amp; Graf, S. (2015). Mobile augmented reality in vocational education and training. Procedia Computer Science, 75, 49â€“58. 
