                " href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10639-024-12602-5#ref-CR127" id="ref-link-section-d81076584e610">2018</a>). Integrating these technologies also positively impacted VE and IT educational systems. It assisted in clarifying the learning of plastic surgery training (Mughal et al., <a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference 2020" title="Mughal, M., Din, A. H., Oâ€™Connor, E. F., Roblin, P., &amp; Rose, V. (2020). Breaking down training barriers: A novel method of delivering plastic surgery training through augmented reality. Journal of Plastic Reconstructive &amp; Aesthetic Surgery. 
