                " href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10639-024-12602-5#ref-CR151" id="ref-link-section-d81076584e619">2020</a>), and manufacturing (Pilati et al., <a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference 2020" title="Pilati, F., Faccio, M., Gamberi, M., &amp; Regattieri, A. (2020). Learning manual assembly through real-time motion capture for operator training with augmented reality. Procedia Manufacturing, 45, 189â€“195. 
