                   . Accessed 26 May 2021." href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10639-024-12602-5#ref-CR161" id="ref-link-section-d81076584e1220">2021</a>a, <a data-track="click" data-track-action="reference anchor" data-track-label="link" data-test="citation-ref" aria-label="Reference b" title="Statista. (2021b). Top XR/AR/VR/MR applications in education 2020. Retrieved from  
